{"seq":10,"trial_id":"v03-pilot-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-company-mu-v03-dev/sy-02-marrow-agrisupply-sites/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-29T16:33:32.677Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"87691b5e154eea4c5586779c1667e1d3f9653ca8ba644778363b00b46a18f473","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","text":"Hi Pree, here's what I found for Marrow Agrisupply (MAS) sites. Some of these are from the brain's account and ticket pages, and the search was keyword-only, so this may not be complete.\n\nFrom #central-team (you can see these directly):\n1. Eastbank: receiving-door import in PD-4821. Doors are labelled E1/E2 in the file but 01/02 in their booking sheet. Source: Hollis, 9 Jun 2026.\n2. Pine Crossing: morning shift missing from the appointment screen. Source: your 9 Jun 2026 message.\n\nFrom the brain (team-central pages, not all visible in #central-team):\n3. Salina cross-dock: Door 4 booking problem. Source: MAS account page (updated 15 Sep 2026).\n4. Kearney depot: call source for MAS. Source: MAS account page.\n5. Two retail distribution cross-docks outside Kearney: Source: MSA signing call notes, 8 Apr 2025. These notes name Darla, who is on the Marrow Fieldworks side, so check whether these belong to MAS.\n6. Enid retail distribution yard: gate clerk login fix, PD-88309. Source: Central weekly, 13 Jul 2026.\n7. Salina store: fertilizer tanker overnight holds. Source: Central weekly, 10 Feb 2025.\n8. Six new stores in onboarding under SUP-5102 (working labels): North Creek, Elm Junction, Prairie Bend, Mill Crossing, West Ridge, South Fork. Source: SUP-5102 ticket page, 9 Jun 2026.\n\nLeft out: Salina Parts Depot, Kearney Machinery Annex and the Salina tractor depot. These belong to Marrow Fieldworks, a separate account.\n\nIf you want a full sweep, the brain search is keyword-only and some pages haven't been indexed yet."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
{"seq":11,"trial_id":"v03-pilot-2026-10/hermes-haiku-gbrain-told-company-mu-v03-dev/sy-02-marrow-agrisupply-sites/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-29T16:33:39.466Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"a2b5a40a49361e1c39768f22e33f3205b54b088b32ec47e7adb301dc7579728d","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","text":"I posted the list to your DM with the sources. Eight sites in total: two from #central-team you can see directly, six from the brain.\n\nThe brain search is keyword-only and was partly degraded, and 118 pages haven't been scanned for entity names, so the list may be incomplete. I left out the Marrow Fieldworks sites (Salina Parts Depot, Kearney Machinery Annex, Salina tractor depot) because they belong to the parent account. The two Kearney-area cross-docks come from the 2025 MSA signing notes and name Darla, who is on the Fieldworks side, so please confirm those are Agrisupply sites before you rely on them."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DV03PIL0001","ts":"1791987000.000125"}}
